{"action": "admitted_narrowed_definition", "admissionScope": "安全标志牌被遮挡这一原子分支；2026-03-01后依据GB2894—2025第7.4.1(e)。", "appliedContentHash": "5e4cb226f946aba7350a19a1b462004b31ae7230e09913680d57fe948f819db1", "appliedLifecycle": "active", "appliedLinkIds": ["K_COM_BREAKER_SIGN_GB2894_7_4_1"], "appliedTitle": "配电装置安全标志牌被贴纸等遮挡", "canonicalHazardId": null, "caseEvidenceStillRequired": true, "continuationBaseCommit": "3d9479ec81b900e3f50ed95468819e0504652d10", "continuationReviewedAsOf": "2026-10-02", "continuedFromDisposition": {"action": "basis_rebind_required", "appliedContentHash": "f092e3e27b91664f8d7723ae59bacdfb9c63db0ebc3bff06de4e0984e2333f3d", "appliedLifecycle": "proposed", "appliedTitle": "配电开关标识被贴纸等遮挡", "canonicalHazardId": null, "caseEvidenceStillRequired": true, "decisionReason": "原件证据已齐但候选语义不能直接纳入5.2.10第2项：正确、齐全不应被无说明改写为清晰/可识别/不被遮挡。本轮不新建direct/fallback K，不把H偷换为编号缺失或错误；保持原稳定ID和全部来源别名，精确记录适用性缺口。", "definitionAdmissionGaps": ["原件证据已齐但候选语义不能直接纳入5.2.10第2项：正确、齐全不应被无说明改写为清晰/可识别/不被遮挡。本轮不新建direct/fallback K，不把H偷换为编号缺失或错误；保持原稳定ID和全部来源别名，精确记录适用性缺口。"], "fieldViolationEstablished": false, "hazardId": "H_COM_BREAKER_LABEL_OBSCURED", "independentLegalReviewStatus": "not_applicable_to_unresolved_or_excluded_definition", "minimumProjectEvidence": ["被遮挡内容是回路编号、功能标记或安全警示的哪一种", "实际设备类别及安装/使用阶段", "遮挡程度及实际可识别性；不得改写成原记录未证明的编号缺失或错误"], "officialSourcesChecked": ["https://jst.nx.gov.cn/xwdt/jrnx/201903/P020220303476468064776.pdf", "https://std.samr.gov.cn/gb/search/gbDetailed?id=N1sPm%2FYzMfc%3D&mode=p"], "originalCitations": ["《商店建筑电气设计规范》JGJ 392—2016 第4.5.3条第1款"], "preReviewContentHash": "d2815998a32e5b25f7602ed8e0d95ef826b95545a2fe9408fc2c1c374c68a42e", "rejectedEvidenceUrls": [{"reason": "实为2015年政府信息公开目录，不是GB50303-2015标准正文；不能用于逐字条文审核。", "url": "https://www.mohurd.gov.cn/cms_files/filemanager/mohurdold/file/2021/20210527/d4cc31f4fb44e2812134acb3bef06364.pdf"}], "releaseEligibleByThisDisposition": false, "remediationEstablished": false, "reusedClauseIds": [], "reviewDecision": "pendi