{"action": "admitted_narrowed_definition", "admissionScope": "限CJJ/T 146—2011第4.4节集中燃气报警控制系统的紧急切断阀。应确认包裹、遮挡或空间不足实际妨碍产品要求的操作或维修更换；不把合规防护罩一概视为隐患。不将自动切换阀、灶前普通手动阀直接视为紧急切断阀；仅有原件称谓或被包裹外观不足以确认个案。\n本项依据为推荐性行业标准，作为限定场景的技术核查参考。具体强制约束须另核适用法律法规、强制性条文或依法适用的设计文件，不单凭本推荐性标准对所有场所作违法认定。", "appliedContentHash": "c302e7b1284b73e75933eac03b4beb2d9f20e491ebb0e31eb3349f22459244f5", "appliedLifecycle": "active", "appliedLinkIds": ["K_COM_20261002_VALVE_OBSTRUCTED_CJJT146_4_4_5"], "appliedTitle": "燃气紧急切断阀安装布置不满足操作和维修要求", "canonicalHazardId": null, "caseEvidenceStillRequired": true, "decisionReason": "4.4.5完整原件直接规定紧急切断阀安装按产品说明书并满足操作、维修更换要求。收窄至集中系统紧急切断阀，自动切换阀来源alias只作为历史来源，不自动判定属于本H。", "definitionAdmissionGaps": [], "fieldViolationEstablished": false, "fullReleaseGateStillRequired": true, "genericDefinitionAdmitted": true, "hazardId": "H_COM_VALVE_OBSTRUCTED", "independentLegalReviewStatus": "passed_bounded_content_scope_currency", "independentReviewRef": "docs/commerce-independent-review-20261002.json#H_COM_VALVE_OBSTRUCTED", "independentReviewSha256": "bf693e5e2418096039e51654bfa7d2dde272cce6964729a51fd7f27b85350d1d", "independentScopeCommentApplied": true, "minimumProjectEvidence": ["阀门型号和实际功能", "包覆是否影响识别/操作/执行动作", "系统设计、说明书和安全功能测试"], "officialSourcesChecked": ["https://cmsfiles.zhongkefu.com.cn/ranqi-new2025/upload/ranqi/67611a1734fff.pdf"], "originalCitations": ["《城镇燃气报警控制系统技术规程》CJJ/T 146—2011 第3.3.2条、第4.4.5条", "《燃气工程项目规范》GB 55009—2021第6.2.1条"], "preAdmissionFinding": "阀门被塑料包覆不自动证明启闭或联动切断失效；原件自动切换阀、紧急切断阀、灶前阀称谓需核实，不能把不同阀型互当依据。", "preReviewContentHash": "824cc30ba78aba91b97269be4a02ecde97321b6aad41deb7039109315125318f", "releaseEligibleByThisDisposition": false, "remediationEstablished": false, "reusedClauseIds": ["C_CJJT146_4_4_5"], "reviewDecision": "verified", "reviewedAsOf": "2026-10-02", "sourceCandidateIds": ["SC044", "SC099"], "sourceDocumentCodes": ["D06", "D11"], "sourceDocumentTextOnly": true, "sourceRead": {"mode": "original_check_record_text", "originalStatementMatched": true, "photosOrFunctionalTestsVerified": false}, "sourceReadAsOf": "2026-10-02", "sourceRevisionBoundary": "已对照当前可访问来源文本和原SC表述；未证明历史文件字节未变，未作原始签名/照片真实性鉴定。", "sourceUseBoundary": "2026-10-02完整原件逐页实审，按明确对象和适用条件准入通用定义；原企业事实另依conditions校验，不代表原现场违法或整改完成。", "title": "燃气紧急切断阀或切换阀被遮挡、包裹"}
{"action": "admitted_narrowed_definition", "admissionScope": "按GB 55037—2022第6.4.2和6.4.3确定部位与耐火性能要求。6.4.3保留直通室外和屋面可采用普通门的例外，建筑高度大于100m的相应部位应为甲级。应结合工程建设/使用条件和依法适用的设计要求核定，不将所有疏散通道门都要求为防火门；木质外观或缺少标牌不当然证明是普通门或耐火不合格，只有性能无法确认时属于待核事实。", "appliedContentHash": "e73b2b4ae0434b925b290c20c67b4abf0d5cf54f16d08589a40d214251db72ce", "appliedLifecycle": "active", "appliedLinkIds": ["K_COM_20261002_WRONG_FIRE_DOOR_GB55037_6_4_2", "K_COM_20261002_WRONG_FIRE_DOOR_GB55037_6_4_3"], "appliedTitle": "应设置防火门的部位使用不符合耐火要求的普通门", "canonicalHazardId": null, "caseEvidenceStillRequired": true, "decisionReason": "官方原PDF第30–31页完整逐字目核6.4.2五项与6.4.3八项及例外条件。移除“性能无法确认即隐患”支，不把6.4.1关闭/烟密闭功能替代应设防火门部位依据。", "definitionAdmissionGaps": [], "fieldViolationEstablished": false, "fullReleaseGateStillRequired": true, "genericDefinitionAdmitted": true, "hazardId": "H_COM_WRONG_FIRE_DOOR", "independentLegalReviewStatus": "passed_bounded_content_scope_currency", "independentReviewRef": "docs/commerce-independent-review-20261002.json#H_COM_WRONG_FIRE_DOOR", "independentReviewSha256": "bf693e5e2418096039e51654bfa7d2dde272cce6964729a51fd7f27b85350d1d", "minimumProjectEvidence": ["原消防设计、建筑用途和具体部位", "门体产品及耐火/防烟性能资料", "闭门/顺序等功能"], "officialSourcesChecked": ["https://zjj.sm.gov.cn/ztzl/xfzt/202401/P020240111381742158956.pdf"], "originalCitations": ["《建筑防火通用规范》GB 55037—2022第6.4.1条至第6.4.3条规定了防火门的关闭、防烟及相应耐火性能要求；防火门产品应符合现行《防火门》GB 12955—2024。"], "preAdmissionFinding": "防火门缺失与产品性能无法核验是两个结论；先确认该位置确需何种防火分隔/门及项目适用要求，再核门体资料或检验，不以木质外观/未见标牌认定普通门。", "preReviewContentHash": "a34b8ebcea2577b2546d62e107bf5e8be993e01a129a0330fac2cc1414659b74", "releaseEligibleByThisDisposition": false, "remediationEstablished": false, "reusedClauseIds": ["C_GB55037_6_4_2", "C_GB55037_6_4_3"], "reviewDecision": "verified", "reviewedAsOf": "2026-10-02", "sourceCandidateIds": ["SC082"], "sourceDocumentCodes": ["D10"], "sourceDocumentTextOnly": true, "sourceRead": {"mode": "original_check_record_text", "originalStatementMatched": true, "photosOrFunctionalTestsVerified": false}, "sourceReadAsOf": "2026-10-02", "sourceRevisionBoundary": "已对照当前可访问来源文本和原SC表述；未证明历史文件字节未变，未作原始签名/照片真实性鉴定。", "sourceUseBoundary": "2026-10-02完整原件逐页实审，按明确对象和适用条件准入通用定义；原企业事实另依conditions校验，不代表原现场违法或整改完成。", "title": "应设置防火门的部位使用普通门或防火性能无法确认"}

